.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Ancel looks like an ordinary twelve-year-old boy,
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]but anyone who spends time with him notices
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]something deeper: a composure, insight, and
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]self-supporting life as a pianist that don't fit his age.
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Playing piano is only his cover. He's a hitman,
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]equipped with every kind of weapon and gadget
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and very good at the job. Clients never meet him,
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]targets never survive him, and his youthful look is
.L 127.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]the ideal disguise. Nobody knows his past.
.CP
.SH
\&Ancel: Attacks
.PP
\&Handgun: Happiness is a warm gun. Well, Ancel never seems to be happy, but close enough.
.PP
\&Sniper Rifle: What better way to carry out one's work but from afar and well out of harm's way?
.PP
\&Length of Wire: If left without other means, Ancel knows how to improvise to take down a target, even if his small frame makes the effort exhausting.
.SH
\&Ancel: Character Hooks
.PP
\&Anyone who angers the wrong person might find Ancel sent after them, and the PCs might try to stop him finishing a job. Or he might just be a friendly face at the local café or bar.
